I assume by manual you meant the ES40 RMC manual. You may find it easier
to tweak the terminal server
ports to match the RMC console settings. Then configure a telnet
listener for the terminal server port.
E.g.,
change telnet listen 2011 port 11
change telnet listen 2011 connection enabled
change port 11 access remote

would permit "telnet terminal_server 2011" to connect to port 11 on the
terminal server.
To change the port 11 characteristics, simply use 
change port 11 ?
to see all the various baud rate/flow control/etc commands to set up
