	This must be tangentially referring to Affinity and Affinity was
	dead long before WindowsAlpha was knifed.  Early on, few were migrating
	from VMS to NT.  That was an insane strategy given the immaturity
	of NT.  Windows 2000 is much stronger but NT was/is impossibly weak
