> I changed the console to serial before, and now I want to change it back.
> But the system hang the booting process by displaying a msg:
>       Console is set to serial.
> The Ctl-C is not working when the booting in progress.
> Now the process can boot into the digtal unix 5.1. Under dgux 5.1, how can I
> reset the Console, so that it is not serial?
