found, it wouldn't even boot from a floppy.

And I didn't find any removable Flash ROM from the "motherboard" (it's a
plugged card), so what can be done?

I really appreciate any answers and help.

Sincerely,
Karo Salminen <kaeesalm@cc.jyu.fi>



